@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@access_token = REPLACE_WITH_TOKEN_FROM_LOGIN_RESPONSE

### List employees - default pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/employees
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### List employees - explicit pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/employees?page=1&limit=5
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### List employees - search by name/code/email
GET {{baseUrl}}/employees?search=grace
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### List employees - filter by status
GET {{baseUrl}}/employees?status=ACTIVE
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### List employees - sort by employeeCode ascending
GET {{baseUrl}}/employees?sortBy=employeeCode&sortOrder=asc
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### List employees - invalid sortBy -> 400 VALIDATION_ERROR
GET {{baseUrl}}/employees?sortBy=departmentId
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### List employees - missing token -> 401 UNAUTHORIZED
GET {{baseUrl}}/employees
